WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.163
The result is state of the art across the board.

00:00:05.243 --> 00:00:10.406
On ZINC-12K,

00:00:10.486 --> 00:00:15.649
PPGN plus plus with degree-six polynomial features
reaches 0.071 test error,

00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:20.891
beating CIN at 0.079 and GIN at 0.163.

00:00:20.971 --> 00:00:26.134
On ZINC-full it hits 0.020 and on Alchemy 0.109,
both best in class.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:31.377
And the features are model-agnostic: adding them to
a plain GatedGCN cuts its ZINC error from 0.265 to 0.106,

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:36.620
all under a modest parameter budget.
